  "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\"><p><br>\n</p>\n<figure class=\"mw-halign-left\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/2/20/Chocolate_Goat.png/revision/latest?cb=20240627195827\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Chocolate Goat\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Chocolate Goat\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><figcaption>Chocolate Goat</figcaption></figure>\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\"><a href=\"/wiki/products-3603\" title=\"Products\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Product</a></h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span>xp</span><span title=\"Experience point(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"xp\"><img alt=\"xp\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/e/e1/Experience.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/25?cb=20160312141717\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span> Exp. lvl(s) 55</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span>chocolateb</span><span title=\"Chocolate Bunny\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"chocolateb\"><img alt=\"chocolateb\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/1/11/Choco_Bunny.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/25?cb=20240626212806\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span>30</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span>time</span><span title=\"Production/Building time\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"time\"><img alt=\"time\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/3/35/Clock.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/25?cb=20160228103426\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span>  1h 30m</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span>xp</span><span title=\"Experience point(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"xp\"><img alt=\"xp\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span> 166</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Source </h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span>Easter Egg Maker</span><span title=\"Easter Egg Maker\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><a href=\"/wiki/easter-egg-maker-35764\" title=\"Easter Egg Maker\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Easter Egg Maker\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"50\" height=\"50\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span></span></div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color pi-collapse pi-collapse-closed\">\n\t<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">+</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Also: </h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span>dia</span><span title=\"Diamond(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"dia\"><img alt=\"dia\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span> 5</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/masteries-6459\" title=\"Masteries\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">★★★</a> </h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">1h 21m</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><b>Chocolate Goat</b> is a <a href=\"/wiki/products-3603\" title=\"Products\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">product</a> unlocked at <a href=\"/wiki/experience-19023\" title=\"Experience\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">experience</a> level 55. It's a special item used only for the Easter event.\n</p><p>Like all <a href=\"/wiki/products-3603\" title=\"Products\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">products</a>, it is stored in the <a href=\"/wiki/barn-2652\" title=\"Barn\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">barn</a>.\n</p>\n<div></div>\n<hr>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Making Chocolate Goat</b></span></h3>\n<figure class=\"mw-halign-left\"><a href=\"/wiki/easter-egg-maker-35764\" title=\"Easter Egg Maker 2024\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Easter Egg Maker 2024\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><figcaption>Easter Egg Maker 2024</figcaption></figure>\n<p>Chocolate goats are made in the <a href=\"/wiki/easter-egg-maker-35764\" title=\"Easter Egg Maker\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Easter Egg Maker</a>.\n</p><p>To make a chocolate goat, players need the following ingredients, in the specified quantities:\n</p>\n<table>\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><span><a href=\"/wiki/goat-milk-2299\" title=\"Goat Milk\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Goat Milk\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"75\" height=\"75\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</td>\n<td><span><a href=\"/wiki/cacao-2248\" title=\"Cacao\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Cacao\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"75\" height=\"75\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</td>\n<td><span><a href=\"/wiki/toffee-2512\" title=\"Toffee\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Toffee\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"75\" height=\"75\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>x1</b>\n</td>\n<td><b>x1</b>\n</td>\n<td><b>x1</b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p>It takes 1 hour and 30 minutes to make a chocolate goat, and 1 hour and 21 minutes in a 2-star and fully <a href=\"/wiki/masteries-6459\" title=\"Masteries\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">mastered</a> station. Each chocolate goat gives players 166 <a href=\"/wiki/experience-19023\" title=\"Experience\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">experience</a> points.\n</p><p><b>In 2025 and 2026</b>, players need the following ingredients, in the specified quantities\n</p>\n<table>\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><span><a href=\"/wiki/toffee-2512\" title=\"Toffee\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Toffee\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"75\" height=\"75\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</td>\n<td><span><a href=\"/wiki/sesame-31883\" title=\"Sesame\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Sesame\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"75\" height=\"75\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</td>\n<td><span><a href=\"/wiki/lily-33000\" title=\"Lily\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Lily\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"75\" height=\"81\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>x1</b>\n</td>\n<td><b>x3</b>\n</td>\n<td><b>x5</b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p>It takes 10 minutes to make a chocolate goat. Each chocolate goat gives players 166 <a href=\"/wiki/experience-19023\" title=\"Experience\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">experience</a> points.\n</p>\n<div></div>\n<hr>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Boat orders</b></span></h3>\n<figure class=\"mw-halign-left\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/2/2c/Riverboat.png/revision/latest?cb=20150712182459\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Riverboat\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Riverboat\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><figcaption>Riverboat</figcaption></figure>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/boat-2675\" title=\"Boat\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Boat</a> orders ask for 1-2 chocolate goats per crate, up to a total of 6 per boat. Each chocolate goat used on a boat will be rewarded with 60 <a href=\"/wiki/chocolate-bunny-36132\" title=\"Chocolate Bunny\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Chocolate Bunny</a>.</li></ul>\n<div></div>\n<hr>\n<p><br>\n</p>\n<table class=\"navbox mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\">\n\n<tbody><tr class=\"navtitle\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/category%2Fcategory-easter-egg-maker-products-35773\" title=\"Category:Easter Egg Maker Products\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Easter Egg Maker Products</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<p><span><a href=\"/wiki/cherry-egg-35766\" title=\"Cherry Egg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Cherry Egg\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n<span><a href=\"/wiki/indigo-egg-35765\" title=\"Indigo Egg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Indigo Egg\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n<span><a href=\"/wiki/peacock-egg-35768\" title=\"Peacock Egg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Peacock Egg\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n<span><a href=\"/wiki/royal-egg-35767\" title=\"Royal Egg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Royal Egg\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n<span><a href=\"/wiki/chocolate-bee-36685\" title=\"Chocolate Bee\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Chocolate Bee\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n<span><a href=\"/wiki/chocolate-chicken-36127\" title=\"Chocolate Chicken\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Chocolate Chicken\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n<span><a href=\"/wiki/chocolate-cow-36126\" title=\"Chocolate Cow\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Chocolate Cow\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n<span><a href=\"/wiki/chocolate-duck-36686\" title=\"Chocolate Duck\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Chocolate Duck\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n<span><a href=\"/wiki/chocolate-goat-36130\" title=\"Chocolate Goat\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Chocolate Goat\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n<span><a href=\"/wiki/chocolate-horse-36687\" title=\"Chocolate Horse\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Chocolate Horse\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n<span><a href=\"/wiki/chocolate-pig-36129\" title=\"Chocolate Pig\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Chocolate Pig\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n<span><a href=\"/wiki/chocolate-sheep-36684\" title=\"Chocolate Sheep\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Chocolate Sheep\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</p>\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"navtitle\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/products-3603\" title=\"Products\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Products</a>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<table>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p><br>\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260901030219\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.080 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.107 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1059/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 6106/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 1228/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 7/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 28/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/200\nLua time usage: 0.009/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 766856/104857600 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   66.133      1 -total\n 65.59%   43.378      1 Template:Infobox\n 27.88%   18.435      6 Template:Infoicon\n 27.37%   18.099      1 Template:Navigation\n 18.64%   12.327      1 Template:EasterEggMakerMenu\n  2.53%    1.670      1 Template:Languages\n  2.01%    1.331      1 Template:PageDisplay\n  1.79%    1.187      3 Template:Clr\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key 1.43.9_prod_hayday:pcache:idhash:36130-0!sseVary=RegularPage!FandomDesktop!LegacyGalleries and timestamp 20260901030219 and revision id 109583. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>",
